  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ee3e47527fa100b4ab6f2bb91cee8588, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialStep_Power
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialStepData
  lines:
  - Now let's learn how to throw!
  - Click and hold, then drag DOWN to start your backswing.
  - A power gauge will appear and swing back and forth.
  - When the gauge is GREEN, your throw will be WEAK.
  - When the gauge is RED, your throw will be STRONG.
  - "Timing is everything \u2014 drag FORWARD when the gauge turns red!"
  - Give it a try. Drag back, wait for red, then release forward!
  condition: 2
  completionLines:
  - Great throw! You've got the power control down.
  - Next, let's learn how to put spin on the ball.
